  "zh": "完整 δW 的螺旋箍缩：**g 两式互证、Λ 式作绝对尺——后者当场抓住了我对 Eq. (9) 的一处抄错**",
  "en": "The full-δW screw pinch: the two forms of g agree, and the Λ form is the absolute scale — it caught my own slip transcribing Eq. (9)"
 },
